      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-09T08:39:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Messy, you have both a lock AND an atomic flag for the same thing, that feels like a design issue.  But as the zram core is doing this, you are stuck with also doing this here I guess, so no further complaints other than \"I trust you all got this right and it\u0027s been tested\" 😊",
      "parentUuid": "8c29a993_70c10a36",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 166,
        "startChar": 5,
